    "summary": {
      "value": "Quicken or delay the growth of your magiseeds"
    },
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements:</strong> you must have mastered <strong>Floralist</strong>.</p><hr><p>When <strong>you fill 1 or more sections of your Growth Clock</strong>, you may choose one option:</p><ul><li><p>You fill <strong>1 additional section</strong> of your <strong>Growth Clock</strong>.</p></li><li><p>You fill <strong>1 fewer section</strong> of your <strong>Growth Clock</strong> (to a minimum of 0 sections filled).</p></li></ul><p>If you do, you cannot use this effect again until after your <strong>Growth Clock</strong> has become completely empty.</p><p>Additionally, damage dealt by your <strong>magiseeds</strong> ignores Resistances.</p>",
